---
/**
 * "Four lines make a wheel" - the scroll-driven opening of the About page.
 *
 * Two-act SVG scrollytelling: act one builds the 1947 mark from four crossing
 * lines into the eight-spoke wheel; act two rolls it from the Darjeeling ridge
 * to the world and back, then a drag-to-spin wheel and a closing line. It is
 * prepended before the existing About content - nothing is replaced.
 *
 * Ported from a standalone prototype with its page chrome stripped so it lives
 * inside the site shell:
 *   - embedded @font-face dropped (the site already loads Syne + Google Sans);
 *   - html{scroll-behavior:smooth} dropped (it fought the site's Lenis scroll);
 *   - box-sizing scoped to .sf; the prototype's own top-bar and footer removed
 *     (the site provides the nav and footer);
 *   - the hero padded to clear the fixed header.
 * Styles are injected is:global because the script draws SVG children at runtime
 * that never receive Astro's scoped hash. The script is is:inline so the
 * self-contained vanilla IIFE runs verbatim.
 */
---

<style is:global>
.sf, .sf *, .sf *::before, .sf *::after{box-sizing:border-box}

/* ── Fonts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
/* ── Tokens ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sf{
  --paper:#FFFFFF;
  --ink:#0B0B0C;
  --red:#E60000;
  --red-deep:#A6121F;
  --hair:#E6E6E8;
  --mute:#77777C;
  --ghost:#EDEDEF;
  --display:'Syne',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --body:'Google Sans Flex','Google Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --gut:clamp(20px,6vw,84px);
  background:var(--paper);
  color:var(--ink);
  font-family:var(--body);
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}




/* ── Shared type ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sf .eyebrow{
  font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.24em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);margin:0;
}
.sf .eyebrow em{font-style:normal;color:var(--red)}
.sf .lede{
  font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(.98rem,1.05vw,1.08rem);
  line-height:1.62;color:var(--mute);max-width:38ch;margin:0;
}
.sf .rule{height:1px;background:var(--hair);border:0;margin:0}

/* ── Top bar ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sf-top{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:22px var(--gut);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair);
}
.sf-top .mark{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:1.02rem;letter-spacing:0}
.sf-top .mark span{color:var(--red)}

/* ── Hero ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sf-hero{
  min-height:88vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  padding:10vh var(--gut) 8vh;position:relative;
}
.sf-hero h1{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(2.9rem,8.2vw,7rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.018em;
  margin:.5em 0 0;max-width:14ch;
}
.sf-hero h1 .w{color:var(--red)}
.sf-hero .lede{margin-top:2rem}
.sf-hero-lines{margin:3.2rem 0 0;width:min(420px,60vw);display:grid;gap:14px}
.sf-hero-lines i{display:block;height:1px;background:var(--ink);opacity:.9;
  transform-origin:left;animation:sfGrow .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) both}
.sf-hero-lines i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.10s;width:82%}
.sf-hero-lines i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.20s;width:64%}
.sf-hero-lines i:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.30s;width:46%;background:var(--red)}
@keyframes sfGrow{from{transform:scaleX(0)}to{transform:scaleX(1)}}
.sf-cue{
  margin-top:auto;padding-top:5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);font-weight:600;
}
.sf-cue b{display:block;width:52px;height:1px;background:var(--red);transform-origin:left;
  animation:sfPulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes sfPulse{0%,100%{transform:scaleX(.35)}50%{transform:scaleX(1)}}

/* ── Scrolly ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sf-scrolly{position:relative;height:640vh}
#sf-build{height:780vh}
.sf-stick{
  position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1.5fr .82fr;align-items:center;
  gap:clamp(20px,4vw,64px);padding:0 var(--gut);
}
.sf-canvas{position:relative;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.sf-canvas svg{width:100%;height:auto;max-height:74vh;overflow:visible}

/* caption stack */
.sf-caps{position:relative;min-height:clamp(230px,34vh,330px)}
.sf-cap{
  position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);pointer-events:none;
  transition:opacity .45s ease,transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);
}
.sf-cap.on{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}
.sf-cap .num{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:.84rem;letter-spacing:.04em;
  color:var(--red);display:block;margin-bottom:1.1rem;
}
.sf-cap h2{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(2rem,4.1vw,3.4rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:0 0 1.1rem;
}
.sf-cap .kind{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:1.4rem;
  font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);font-weight:600;
}
.sf-cap .kind s{display:block;width:34px;height:0;border-top:4px solid var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
.sf-cap .kind s.dash{border-top-style:dashed}
.sf-cap .kind s.chev{position:relative}
.sf-cap .kind s.chev::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:0;top:-5px;width:7px;height:7px;
  border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-right:2px solid var(--ink);transform:rotate(45deg)}
.sf-cap .kind s.node{position:relative}
.sf-cap .kind s.node::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-4px;top:-4px;width:6px;height:6px;
  border:1.5px solid var(--ink);background:#fff}

/* progress rail */
.sf-rail{
  position:absolute;left:calc(var(--gut) * .42);top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);
  width:1px;height:34vh;background:var(--hair);
}
.sf-rail b{position:absolute;top:0;left:-1px;width:3px;background:var(--red);height:0}
.sf-rail u{
  position:absolute;left:10px;top:100%;margin-top:10px;text-decoration:none;
  font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.18em;font-weight:600;color:var(--mute);white-space:nowrap;
}
@media(max-width:900px){.sf-rail{display:none}}

/* ── Chapter divider ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sf-chapter{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(14px,2.5vw,26px);
  padding:clamp(44px,8vw,96px) var(--gut) clamp(28px,4vw,44px)}
.sf-chapter hr{flex:1}
.sf-chapter span{font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;
  font-weight:600;color:var(--mute);white-space:nowrap}
.sf-chapter span b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

/* ── Journey stage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
#jr-stage{overflow:hidden}
.jr-line{fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-linecap:round}
.jr-stem{stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;fill:none}
.jr-dot{fill:var(--ink)}
.jr-red .jr-stem{stroke:var(--red)}
.jr-red .jr-dot{fill:var(--red)}
.jr-mer{fill:none;stroke:var(--hair);stroke-width:1.4}
.jr-rule{stroke:var(--hair);stroke-width:1.4;stroke-linecap:round}
#sf-roll .sf-canvas{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:clamp(10px,1.8vw,22px)}
.jr-axis{width:100%}
.jr-track{position:relative;height:1px;background:var(--hair)}
.jr-track i{position:absolute;top:-4px;width:1px;height:9px;background:var(--hair);transform:translateX(-50%)}
.jr-track b{position:absolute;top:-4.5px;left:0;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--red);transform:translateX(-50%)}
.jr-stops{position:relative;height:1.2em;margin-top:13px}
.jr-stops span{position:absolute;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;
  font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;
  color:var(--mute);opacity:.45;transition:opacity .3s ease,color .3s ease}
.jr-stops span.on{opacity:1;color:var(--red)}
.jr-tele{display:flex;gap:26px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:14px;
  font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--mute)}
.jr-tele var{font-style:normal;color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
#sf-roll .sf-cap .lede .w{display:inline-block;opacity:.08;transform:translateY(5px)}
.jr-lab{font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.2em;
  text-transform:uppercase;fill:var(--mute)}
.jr-val{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:31px;fill:var(--ink)}
.jr-val.red{fill:var(--red)}

/* ── Interactive section ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sf-play{
  border-top:1px solid var(--hair);padding:clamp(56px,9vw,120px) var(--gut);
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,80px);align-items:center;
}
.sf-play h2{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3.6rem);
  line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:1.1rem 0 1.3rem;
}
.sf-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:2rem 0 1.4rem;padding:0;list-style:none}
.sf-chip{
  font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid var(--hair);background:#fff;color:var(--ink);
  cursor:pointer;border-radius:999px;transition:border-color .2s,color .2s,background .2s;
}
.sf-chip:hover,.sf-chip[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}
.sf-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--red);outline-offset:3px}
.sf-readout{
  display:flex;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid var(--hair);padding-top:16px;
  font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);font-weight:600;
}
.sf-readout var{font-style:normal;color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.sf-wheel{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.sf-wheel svg{width:min(100%,460px);height:auto;cursor:grab;touch-action:pan-y}
.sf-wheel use{transition:fill .35s ease}
.sf-cons{fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.6}
.sf-cons.bar{fill:rgba(11,11,12,.07);transition:opacity .3s ease}
#sf-axes{transition:opacity .3s ease}
.sf-wheel svg:active{cursor:grabbing}
.sf-wheel svg:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--red);outline-offset:8px;border-radius:50%}

/* ── Close ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
/* Holds only the replay control now (the manifesto text moved to its own
   section), so it is a slim centred band rather than the tall text block. */
.sf-close{
  border-top:1px solid var(--hair);padding:clamp(24px,3.4vw,40px) var(--gut);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;
}
.sf-close p{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.4vw,2.6rem);
  line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-.012em;margin:0;max-width:22ch;
}
.sf-close p em{font-style:normal;color:var(--red)}
.sf-again{
  font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ink);background:none;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--red);
  padding:0 0 6px;cursor:pointer;
}
.sf-again:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--red);outline-offset:4px}
.sf-foot{
  border-top:1px solid var(--hair);padding:20px var(--gut);display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;
  font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);font-weight:600;
}

/* ── SVG stage bits ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.sf-bar{fill:none;stroke-linecap:butt}
.sf-cut{fill:none;stroke:var(--paper);stroke-linecap:butt}
.sf-ring{fill:none;stroke:var(--red);stroke-linecap:butt}
.sf-hub{fill:none;stroke:var(--paper);stroke-width:2.8}
.sf-guide{stroke:var(--hair);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none}
.sf-tag{
  font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.18em;
  text-transform:uppercase;fill:var(--ink);
}
.sf-word{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:76px;letter-spacing:-.012em;fill:var(--ink)}
.sf-word tspan{fill:var(--red)}
.sf-sub{font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.22em;fill:var(--mute)}

/* ── Responsive ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
@media(max-width:900px){
  .sf-stick{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:1fr auto;
    align-content:center;gap:8px;padding:clamp(96px,15vh,132px) var(--gut) 36px}
  .sf-canvas svg{max-height:50vh}
  .jr-stops span{opacity:0}
  .jr-stops span.on{opacity:1;left:50%!important}
  .jr-tele{justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
  .sf-tag{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .sf-word{font-size:96px}
  .sf-sub{font-size:24px}
  .sf-caps{min-height:236px}
  .sf-play,.sf-close{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .sf-play{display:flex;flex-direction:column-reverse;align-items:stretch}
  .sf-hero{min-height:80vh}
}

/* ── Reduced motion ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  
  .sf *,.sf *::before,.sf *::after{animation-duration:.001ms!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}
}

/* clear the site's fixed header (added for the in-site embed) */
.sf .sf-hero{padding-top:clamp(150px,20vh,240px)}
</style>

<section class="sf" aria-label="How the 1947 mark is built from four lines, and where it travels">

<!-- shared mark definition -->
<svg width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute">
  <defs>
    <g id="sf-mark">
      <path transform="scale(4.65116279) translate(-21.5,-21.5)" d="M20.9017 0.00715656C26.6349 -0.138394 32.0678 1.9402 36.2338 5.87825C40.3915 9.80817 42.7634 15.1291 42.9096 20.8382C43.0556 26.547 40.9765 31.9732 37.0219 36.1214C33.0753 40.2695 27.7482 42.631 22.015 42.7767C16.2819 42.9223 10.8489 40.8436 6.68299 36.9056C2.52518 32.9756 0.153378 27.6546 0.00721264 21.9456C-0.13895 16.2366 1.94019 10.8107 5.89491 6.66243C9.84144 2.51422 15.1767 0.152818 20.9017 0.00715656ZM23.0053 14.5462C22.4531 14.4089 21.8684 14.3522 21.2758 14.3685C20.6829 14.3846 20.0981 14.4896 19.5541 14.6351L19.2699 3.74348C15.6562 4.18017 12.3835 5.69224 9.77674 7.95638L17.7025 15.4603C16.72 16.0829 15.9001 16.9486 15.3236 17.9593L7.39784 10.4554C5.27023 13.1643 3.93015 16.5116 3.6703 20.1263L14.5922 19.8431C14.4541 20.401 14.3972 20.9833 14.4135 21.5736C14.4297 22.1638 14.5359 22.7385 14.682 23.2884L3.75917 23.5706C4.20581 27.1771 5.73305 30.4447 7.99061 33.0404L15.5101 25.14C16.1354 26.1183 17.0041 26.935 18.0189 27.5091L10.4994 35.4017C13.2198 37.5284 16.5739 38.8627 20.1957 39.1214L19.9115 28.2288C20.4636 28.3663 21.0482 28.4227 21.641 28.4066C22.2337 28.3903 22.8186 28.2855 23.3627 28.14L23.6469 39.0325C27.2605 38.5959 30.5333 37.0757 33.14 34.8197L25.2142 27.3148C26.1967 26.6922 27.0175 25.8275 27.5941 24.8167L35.5199 32.3206C37.6475 29.6117 38.9865 26.2633 39.2465 22.6488L28.3246 22.932C28.4626 22.3741 28.5195 21.7917 28.5033 21.2015C28.487 20.6113 28.381 20.0374 28.2348 19.4876L39.1576 19.2044C38.711 15.5979 37.1919 12.3314 34.9262 9.73567L27.4066 17.6361C26.7813 16.6576 25.9129 15.8401 24.8978 15.2659L32.4174 7.36556H32.4252C29.7047 5.2471 26.3509 3.90459 22.7211 3.64583L23.0053 14.5462ZM21.3168 15.9124C24.354 15.8396 26.88 18.2249 26.9613 21.2572C27.0345 24.2896 24.6382 26.8124 21.601 26.8851C18.5639 26.9578 16.0386 24.5728 15.9574 21.5404C15.8843 18.5081 18.2798 15.9852 21.3168 15.9124Z"/>
    </g>
  </defs>
</svg>
<!-- ── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="sf-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Data · Design · Technology · Communication</p>
  <h1>Four lines make a <span class="w">wheel</span>.</h1>
  <div class="sf-hero-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  <p class="lede">Our logo is not a drawing of a wheel. It is four straight lines,
     pinned at one point and set turning — in Darjeeling, at 2,042 metres.
     Scroll to build it, then follow where it rolls.</p>
  <div class="sf-cue"><b></b> Scroll to build the mark</div>
</section>

<div class="sf-chapter">
  <hr class="rule"><span>Act one — <b>The build</b></span><hr class="rule">
</div>

<!-- ── SCROLLY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="sf-scrolly" id="sf-build">
  <div class="sf-stick">

    <div class="sf-rail" aria-hidden="true"><b id="sf-fill"></b><u id="sf-count">01 / 06</u></div>

    <div class="sf-canvas">
      <svg id="sf-stage" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" role="img"
           aria-label="Four lines cross at a single centre, forty-five degrees apart, giving the eight ends that a closing circle turns into the 1947 eight-spoked wheel.">

        <!-- construction guides -->
        <g id="sf-guides" opacity="0">
          <circle class="sf-guide" cx="500" cy="500" r="330"/>
          <circle class="sf-guide" cx="500" cy="500" r="275"/>
          <circle class="sf-guide" cx="500" cy="500" r="84"/>
          <path class="sf-guide" d="M500 130 L500 870 M130 500 L870 500"
                stroke-dasharray="3 9" opacity=".85" transform="rotate(-1.5 500 500)"/>
        </g>

        <!-- four lines, crossing -->
        <g id="sf-lines">
          <g id="sf-g0" opacity="0"><line class="sf-bar" id="sf-l0"/><g id="sf-d0"></g></g>
          <g id="sf-g1" opacity="0"><line class="sf-bar" id="sf-l1"/><g id="sf-d1"></g></g>
          <g id="sf-g2" opacity="0"><line class="sf-bar" id="sf-l2"/><g id="sf-d2"></g></g>
          <g id="sf-g3" opacity="0"><line class="sf-bar" id="sf-l3"/><g id="sf-d3"></g></g>
        </g>

        <!-- the hub, inscribed in the crossing -->
        <circle class="sf-hub" id="sf-hub" cx="500" cy="500" r="84.4" opacity="0"/>

        <!-- one circle closes it -->
        <circle class="sf-ring" id="sf-ring" cx="500" cy="500" r="302.35"
                stroke-width="55.3" opacity="0" transform="rotate(-90 500 500)"/>

        <!-- the finished mark -->
        <g id="sf-logo" opacity="0">
          <use href="#sf-mark" transform="translate(500,500) scale(3.3)" fill="var(--red)"/>
        </g>

        <!-- travelling name tags -->
        <g id="sf-tags">
          <text class="sf-tag" id="sf-t0" opacity="0">Data</text>
          <text class="sf-tag" id="sf-t1" opacity="0">Design</text>
          <text class="sf-tag" id="sf-t2" opacity="0">Technology</text>
          <text class="sf-tag" id="sf-t3" opacity="0">Communication</text>
        </g>

        <!-- wordmark -->
        <g id="sf-lockup" opacity="0">
          <text class="sf-word" x="500" y="945" text-anchor="middle">1947<tspan>.</tspan></text>
        </g>
      </svg>

      </div>

    <div class="sf-caps">
      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="0">
        <span class="num">Line 01</span>
        <span class="kind"><s></s> Ruled — measured in increments</span>
        <h2>Data</h2>
        <p class="lede">The first line is a measurement. Evidence set end to end: what happened,
          how often, to whom. Read it and you know exactly one thing — and it points in exactly
          one direction.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="1">
        <span class="num">Line 02</span>
        <span class="kind"><s class="node"></s> Handled — a line with tension</span>
        <h2>Design</h2>
        <p class="lede">The second line gives the first a shape worth following. It decides where
          the eye starts, what it can skip, where it rests. Beautiful, and still just an edge.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="2">
        <span class="num">Line 03</span>
        <span class="kind"><s class="dash"></s> Sampled — repeatable, discrete</span>
        <h2>Technology</h2>
        <p class="lede">The third line makes it run. It takes what was measured and drawn and
          repeats it a thousand times a second without tiring. On its own it has nowhere to go.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="3">
        <span class="num">Line 04</span>
        <span class="kind"><s class="chev"></s> Directed — carries both ways</span>
        <h2>Communication</h2>
        <p class="lede">The fourth line is the one that leaves the building. It decides what gets
          said, to whom, and in what order — and whether the other three are ever noticed at all.
          On its own it has nothing to carry.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="4">
        <span class="num">The crossing</span>
        <h2>One centre</h2>
        <p class="lede">Lay all four through a single point, forty-five degrees apart. Four lines,
          eight ends — the exact spoke count of the finished mark. Nothing is added to reach it.
          The hub is simply the circle they all turn around.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="5">
        <span class="num">The rim</span>
        <h2>One circle</h2>
        <p class="lede">Draw a single circle across the eight ends and the lines stop being lines —
          they're spokes. Nothing is dropped and nothing is invented. The wheel just closes, and
          reads the same however it turns.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="sf-chapter">
  <hr class="rule"><span>Act two — <b>The journey</b></span><hr class="rule">
</div>

<!-- ── JOURNEY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="sf-scrolly" id="sf-roll">
  <div class="sf-stick">

    <div class="sf-rail" aria-hidden="true"><b id="jr-fill"></b><u id="jr-count">01 / 05</u></div>

    <div class="sf-canvas">
      <svg id="jr-stage" viewBox="0 0 1200 690" role="img"
           aria-label="The wheel rolls from the Darjeeling ridge, down through the plains towns and the metros, until the horizon curves into a globe, then back to the ridge and its people.">
        <g id="jr-mer" opacity="0"></g>
        <g id="jr-ruler" opacity="0"></g>
        <path id="jr-ground" class="jr-line" d="M0 0"/>
        <g id="jr-marks"></g>
        <circle id="jr-occ" cx="600" cy="374" r="55" fill="#fff"/>
        <g id="jr-wheel"><use href="#sf-mark" transform="scale(0.52)" fill="var(--red)"/></g>
      </svg>

      <div class="jr-axis" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="jr-track">
          <i style="left:9.5%"></i><i style="left:28.5%"></i><i style="left:46.5%"></i>
          <i style="left:68.5%"></i><i style="left:91%"></i>
          <b id="jr-pos"></b>
        </div>
        <div class="jr-stops">
          <span style="left:9.5%">Darjeeling</span>
          <span style="left:28.5%">The plains</span>
          <span style="left:46.5%">The metros</span>
          <span style="left:68.5%">The world</span>
          <span style="left:91%">Darjeeling</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jr-tele">
          <span>Elevation <var id="jr-alt">2,042 m</var></span>
          <span>Rolled <var id="jr-rev">0.0 rev</var></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sf-caps">
      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="0">
        <span class="num">Stop 01</span>
        <h2>Darjeeling</h2>
        <p class="lede">Two thousand and forty-two metres up, where the road bends back on
          itself every hundred yards and nothing arrives quickly. A place that teaches you
          to make things that travel light.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="1">
        <span class="num">Stop 02</span>
        <h2>The plains</h2>
        <p class="lede">The first stretch is short. Siliguri, Kalimpong, Gangtok — the corridor
          where the hills hand over to the plains. Work made up there starts turning up down
          here, on shopfronts and signboards, in hands that never asked where it came from.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="2">
        <span class="num">Stop 03</span>
        <h2>The metros</h2>
        <p class="lede">Then the buildings get taller and the briefs get longer. Kolkata, Delhi,
          Bengaluru, Mumbai. Same four lines, same wheel — just further to roll between stops.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="3">
        <span class="num">Stop 04</span>
        <h2>The world</h2>
        <p class="lede">Roll far enough in one direction and the ground stops being flat.
          Time zones turn into a scheduling detail, a studio in the hills turns out to be a
          studio anywhere, and the horizon closes into a circle.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sf-cap" data-i="4">
        <span class="num">Full circle</span>
        <h2>Darjeeling</h2>
        <p class="lede">A circle only goes one place. Back up the switchbacks, past the tea,
          to the people who built it, taught it, and are still standing on that ridge.
          The wheel doesn't finish anywhere. It comes home.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── INTERACTIVE ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="sf-play">
